#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to primitives in Qiskit Runtime, and an explanation of "
"available primitives"
msgstr ""
"Pengantar primitif di Qiskit Runtime, dan penjelasan tentang primitif yang "
"tersedia"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives"
msgstr "Pengantar primitif"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Pengantar primitif {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitif dibuat untuk menyederhanakan tugas paling umum pada komputer "
"kuantum: yaitu, sampling state kuantum dan menghitung nilai ekspektasi. "
"Primitif Qiskit Runtime pertama "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) dan "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) adalah implementasi dari [kelas dasar "
"primitif](/guides/primitives) Qiskit. Keduanya menyediakan implementasi yang"
" lebih canggih (misalnya, dengan menyertakan mitigasi error) sebagai layanan"
" berbasis cloud dan digunakan untuk mengakses hardware IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitif Qiskit Runtime terbaru, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(yang masih dalam beta), menyediakan antarmuka tingkat lebih rendah yang "
"memberikan visibilitas dan kontrol lebih tanpa mengorbankan performa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Menghitung nilai ekspektasi untuk satu atau lebih observabel terhadap state yang disiapkan oleh Circuit kuantum. Memiliki metode penekanan dan mitigasi error bawaan.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Quickstart Estimator\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Mengambil sampel register output dari eksekusi satu atau lebih Circuit kuantum.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Quickstart Sampler\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Mengambil sampel register output dari eksekusi Circuit kuantum berdasarkan arahan input dan memberimu kontrol penuh serta transparansi dalam mengustomisasi metode mitigasi error.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Quickstart Executor\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Pelajari [primitif Qiskit](/guides/primitives) yang menjadi dasar primitif Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Tinjau contoh-contoh detail [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), atau [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Lihat detail input dan output untuk [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), dan [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif melalui [pelajaran fungsi biaya](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) di IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Lihat [referensi API EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [referensi API SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), dan [referensi API Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Baca [Migrasi ke primitif V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
